<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104842" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίβων</span></b>  (B) [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωνος</span>, ὁ, ἡ,</span>
		Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>practised</i> or <i>skilled
				in</i> a thing, <i>used to</i> it, c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίβων αὐτῆς</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς καννάβιος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.74
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. λόγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					717
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἱππικῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					1429
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κρεμαθρῶν οὔπω τ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					869
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἔργων τῆς ἰατρικῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					15.169
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18(2).35
			</span></i>: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίβων τὰ τοιάδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					686
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>El.</u>
				1127
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					766.4
				</span></i>
			:— hence </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst., <i>'old hand', rogue,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				869
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				870
			</span></i> (a pun).</div>
